 "strings": {
  "And if it didn't?": "",
  "Let's... Let's try and stay optimistic.": "",
  "Well, if it didn't...\nLet's not think about that.": "",
  "Well, camera.\nYou got good news for us or what?": "",
  "Heh. Well, it must've caught <font_kind=yakuza_italic>something</font_kind>.\nGuess we'll see.": "",
  "What happened in there?": "",
  "What happened in there, Seiya?": "",
  "I... I can't do it. I'm so sorry.": "",
  "I... I can't do it.\nI'm so sorry.": "",
  "But why!? You were all ready to go this morning!": "",
  "But why not!?\nYou were all ready to go this morning!": "",
  "I... got a phone call earlier.": "",
  "Go on.": "",
  "A call?": "",
  "It said it was from my sister...\nBut there was a strange man on the line.": "",
  "It said it was from my sister...\nbut when I picked up, it was a man's voice.": "",
  "He said his name was Murase.\nTold me you'd know him, Yagami-san.": "",
  "He said he was Murase of the Kyorei Clan.\nTold me you'd know him, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Murase...\nAnd he told you not to testify?": "",
  "And Murase...\nHe told you not to testify?": "",
  "Yes. He said if I did...\nIf I did... I'd never see my sister again.": "",
  "Yes. He said if I did...\nIf I did... I'd never see my sister again...": "",
  "What are you doing, Yagami?\nCalling the police?": "",
  "Hey, what are you doing, Yagami?\nCalling the police?": "",
  "Kaito-san. It's me.\nThose KJ Art guys took Seiya's sister.": "",
  "Kaito-san. It's Yagami.\nWe're paying the Kyorei a visit at KJ Art.": "",
  "I'm heading over there now.\nCould use a hand.": "",
  "They kidnapped our witness's sister.\nCould use a hand.": "",
  "The hell are you doing?\nWe're in the middle of a trial here!": "",
  "A trial doesn't mean shit\nif you can't protect your witness!": "",
  "A trial doesn't mean shit if you\ncan't protect your witness!": "",
  "Buy me as much time as you can.\nI'll get Seiya's sister back.": "",
  "Buy me as much time as you can.\nI'll get Seiya's sister back, no matter what.": "",
  "I'm the one who dragged you into this.\nI'll be the one to drag you out. Promise.": "",
  "I'm the one who dragged you into this.\nI'll be the one to drag you and your sister out. Promise.": "",
  "Buy time he says...\nHe knows this is a court, right!?": "",
  "Like I can just \"buy time\"...\nWhat now?": "",
  "(The Kyorei have Seiya's sister at KJ Art.\nI need to hurry.)": "",
  "(No time for detours.\nI need to save Seiya's sister before the recess ends!)": "",
  "Yo, it's Kaito. I'm here.\nWhere are you?": "",
  "It's Kaito. I'm at KJ Art.\nWhere are you?": "",
  "I'm right around the corner.": "",
  "On my way. Almost there.": "",
  "Place looks kinda deserted, blinds down and everything.\nAre we sure this is where they've got her?": "",
  "Place looks kinda deserted, blinds down and everything.\nDunno if anyone's even here. You sure they've got her?": "",
  "They're from Kansai, remember?\nThey can't have that many hideouts.": "",
  "The Kyorei aren't from around here.\nThey can't have that many hideouts.": "",
  "Plus...": "",
  "Plus what?": "",
  "I bet there's a reason all the blinds are down.\nIf anything, that makes it more suspicious.": "",
  "I bet there's a reason all the blinds are down.\nIf anything, that makes it <font_kind=yakuza_italic>more</font_kind> likely they have her.": "",
  "I guess you've got a point.": "",
  "Yeah, true... You got a point there.": "",
  "Anyways, I'll be up on the roof again.\nSee you soon.": "",
  "Anyways, I'll be up on the roof again.\nMeet me where we spied on KJ Art before. See you soon.": "",
  "Still can't get eyes on what's in there.\nGot any bright ideas?": "",
  "There you are. Still can't see inside...\nAny ideas?": "",
  "Well we can't just barge in.\nWho knows how many of them are in there.": "",
  "No way I'm getting away\nwith a disguise now, either.": "",
  "No way I'm getting away with\na disguise now, either.": "",
  "Then... I guess we gotta sneak in?": "",
  "Then... I guess we gotta sneak in?\nDo things all stealthy?": "",
  "That's the only way.": "",
  "Yeah. That's the only way.": "",
  "Heh, I had a feeling.\nI've got a plan.": "",
  "Yeah, lay it on me.": "",
  "Oh? Lay it on me.": "",
  "First, I'll make a big scene out front. Then when\nthey're distracted, you sneak in and get the girl.": "",
  "First, I'll make a big scene out front. Then, when\nthey're distracted, you sneak in and get the girl.": "",
  "That's your big plan?": "",
  "<font_kind=yakuza_italic>That's</font_kind> your plan!?": "",
  "Pretty good, huh?": "",
  "Uh. Sure.\nHow you gonna do it?": "",
  "Uh, sure.\nBut how are you gonna distract them?": "",
  "You'll see soon enough. Just remember,\nboth our asses are on the line here.": "",
  "Well, uh... You'll see soon enough.\nJust remember, both our lives are on the line here.": "",
  "I won't forget.": "",
  "So... the girl's in there, yeah?\nLet's go bring her home.": "",
  "So the girl's in there, yeah?\nLet's go bring her home.": "",
  "Right. I'll go look for a way in.\nLet you know when I find one.": "",
  "Got it. I'll go look for a way in.\nLet you know when I find one.": "",
  "What the fuck!?": "",
  "The hell was that?": "",
  "Hey! Where's that asshole Murase!?\nName's Kaito! Ex-Matsugane!": "",
  "Hey, where's that asshole Murase!?\nName's Kaito! Ex-Matsugane!": "",
  "Bring him out,\nor I'll burn this shit down!": "",
  "Get fuckin' Murase out here or I'll\nburn this goddamn building down!": "",
  "Oh yeah!? Go on, I dare you!\nJust stay right there, punk!": "",
  "Oh, just fuckin' try it!\nYou stay right there, punk!": "",
  "Go, Tak!\nThis is your chance!": "",
  "On it. Don't die, okay?": "",
  "Right.\nDon't die on me, Kaito-san.": "",
  "You really stuck around?\nYou shoulda bailed when you had the chance!": "",
  "You got some serious guts stickin' around!\nI thought you'd be halfway 'cross town by now!": "",
  "You're pretty fucked now... Dumbass!": "",
  "Get ready to die, fuckhead!": "",
  "Who the fuck are you!?\nI said I wanted Murase!": "",
  "Who the hell are you?\nI thought I said I want Murase.": "",
  "You fuckin' scrubs ain't worth\nmy time. Get Murase!": "",
  "I'm not here for the scrubs!\nBring that asshole out!": "",
  "Hey, the hell's going on!?": "",
  "Bastards're attacking us!": "",
  "Someone grab a gun!": "",
  "Is it the Tojo!?": "",
  "What's he take us for,\ncoming here alone!?": "",
  "Dammit, this guy's got balls!": "",
  "(It's locked, but I should be able to open it with\na simple thumb turn bypass.)": "",
  "Who the hell're you?": "",
  "You're not getting outta here alive!": "",
  "You! Where's the girl you took?": "",
  "I don't know nothing, honest!\nI'm new here. They don't tell me shit!": "",
  "I-I dunno! I'm new here.\nThey don't tell me shit!": "",
  "Huh? Then you're useless to me.": "",
  "...No way to go but up.": "",
  "...In that case, no way to go but up.": "",
  "You're done for, bitch!": "",
  "(She might be on this floor...)": "",
  "Now. Tell me what I want to know...\nOr else.": "",
  "Oh, you're up again.\nTell me what I want to know.": "",
  "Where's the girl?": "",
  "She's... up in the reception room.": "",
  "Got it. Appreciate the honesty.": "",
  "The reception room.\nAppreciate the honesty.": "",
  "Where's Murase?": "",
  "Hell if I know. Probably with the girl.": "",
  "Hell if I know.\nI mean, he's probably with the girl.": "",
  "Yeah, probably...": "",
  "How many of you Kyorei guys are there?": "",
  "Heh, who knows? 50? 100?": "",
  "Heh, dunno.\nFifty, a hundred...": "",
  "Any way you slice it, you're trapped.\nNo chance you leave here alive.": "",
  "Shut it.": "",
  "What's the code for the reception room?": "",
  "Like I'd tell you.": "",
  "I don't have time for your games.\nUnderstand?": "",
  "I'm done playing around here.\nWe understand each other?": "",
  "Now, I'm gonna ask you again.\nWhat's the code to the reception room?": "",
  "Now, I'm gonna ask you again. This is your last chance.\nWhat's the code to the reception room?": "",
  "Well that wasn't so hard.\nThanks.": "",
  "...1370, then. Thanks.": "",
  "(It's the reception room...)": "",
  "(Dammit, I need a code to get in.)": "",
  "(Not gonna be able to pick my way in, either.\nThe lock's too high-tech for that.)": "",
  "(I'll need to figure out the code somehow...!)": "",
  "(1370. Time to give it a try.)": "",
  "Heh, I knew you'd be back!": "",
  "Why didn't you tell me there was a code?\nCough it up.": "",
  "Not happening, dumbass.\nYou're dead meat!": "",
  "Dumbass! I don't have to tell you shit!\nYou're dead meat!": "",
  "You're Seiya's sister, right?\nDon't worry, you're safe now.": "",
  "Yagami?\nWhen the hell did you get here?": "",
  "Yagami? When the hell did you—": "",
  "Let the girl go.\nRight now.": "",
  "Let the girl go. Now.": "",
  "Whaddya mean, let her go?": "",
  "Let her go? What do you mean?": "",
  "The girl can leave whenever she wants.\nWe don't have her tied up or nothing.": "",
  "I get it. It's all fine if you aren't\nkeeping her \"captive,\" right?": "",
  "You just have to make her stay here until the trial's\nover. You really thought this one through.": "",
  "Just have to make her stay here until the trial's over.\nThat your plan?": "",
  "But that's not gonna work.": "",
  "Confinement is a crime whether or not your\ncaptive is tied up, idiots.": "",
  "Confinement constitutes more than just tying\nsomeone up. Read up.": "",
  "Shut your trap!": "",
  "You know, false imprisonment'll get you between three months\nand seven years. Maybe even longer if you hurt the victim.": "",
  "By the way, false imprisonment is three months\nto seven years, longer if you hurt the victim.": "",
  "Guess she'll have to take a little dip in\nan acid bath, then. No body, no crime.": "",
  "Guess she'll have to take a little dip\nin an acid bath, then. No body, no crime.": "",
  "Intimidation too?\nTack on another year.": "",
  "Intimidation, too?\nAnother one for the pile, huh?": "",
  "You piece of...": "",
  "C'mon, let's make sure this asshole\nnever talks again!": "",
  "Not so fast, Yagami.": "",
  "Murase-san.\nHasn't this gone on long enough?": "",
  "You're only gonna make things\nworse for yourself.": "",
  "Hamura has an alibi.\nSomeone else clearly killed Kume.": "",
  "There's no reason for you\nto keep Seiya from testifying.": "",
  "Even if you silence Seiya's testimony,\nthat doesn't help you at all.": "",
  "But if Hamura didn't murder Kume,\nwho did?": "",
  "But... then who did kill Kume?": "",
  "I'm not sure.\nBut...": "",
  "I'm not sure, but...": "",
  "But what?": "",
  "Hamura might have an idea. He must have\nbeen working with the real murderer.": "",
  "Hamura might have an idea. I think...\nhe was working with the real murderer.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(That's right. Several facts point to\nHamura's involvement.)</color>": "",
  "The night of the crime, Kume went into Amour\nand just... disappeared, right?": "",
  "The night of the crime, Kume went into Amour\nand just disappeared, right?": "",
  "He didn't contact you. Nobody saw him.\nHe didn't even show up on any security footage.": "",
  "The way I see it, Kume never left Amour.": "",
  "In other words, Hamura must have handed\nhim over to the real murderer.": "",
  "Hamura must have handed him over\nto the real murderer.": "",
  "While Hamura was at the sauna making an alibi\nfor himself, someone else was murdering Kume.": "",
  "And gouging his eyes out.": "",
  "It almost makes sense.": "",
  "...Makes sense.": "",
  "If Hamura ends up behind bars,\nI'll never be able to prove that theory.": "",
  "So what, you wanna let Hamura walk?": "",
  "So Hamura gets to walk?\nAll 'cause of your big theories?": "",
  "Better that than threaten a girl\nto stop someone from testifying.": "",
  "Better that than threatening a girl\nto stop someone from testifying.": "",
  "Besides, I thought you were\nabove shit like this.": "",
  "Hmph. All right, just get outta here.\nYou got guts for a detective.": "",
  "Hmph. Fine. Get outta here.\nYou got guts for a detective.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(The rest is up to Shintani.)</color>": "",
  "Hamura-san is the one punching me in this video.\nThe same man standing here today.": "",
  "He's the one punching me in this video.\nThe same man standing there. Hamura of the Matsugane Family.": "",
  "I remember now.\nThere's no doubt in my mind.": "",
  "So you retract your earlier statement?": "",
  "Yes. My apologies.": "",
  "Your Honor!\nClearly this witness has no credibility!": "",
  "How does the defense respond?": "",
  "I admit, the witness was\nshaken up before.": "",
  "But I believe that's a perfectly understandable response.\nThis is his first time in court, after all.": "",
  "However, that's a perfectly understandable response.\nThis is his first time in court, after all.": "",
  "I have no doubts regarding\nhis credibility.": "",
  "This Stardust establishment.\nIt's a host club, yes?": "",
  "So this Stardust establishment in Kamurocho.\nIt's a host club, yes?": "",
  "How long have you been\nemployed there?": "",
  "About two years.": "",
  "For that short a timeframe, you seem to\nhave an awful lot of trouble with your customers.": "",
  "For that short a timeframe, you seem to have\nan awful lot of trouble with your customers.": "",
  "Huh? I'm not sure what you mean.": "",
  "Huh? What do you mean?": "",
  "Several of them have approached you\nin hopes of marriage, have they not?": "",
  "They come spending huge sums of cash,\nso you act like you're ready to seal the deal.": "",
  "You say whatever it takes to make them happy in the moment,\nbut your story changes once things start to get real.": "",
  "You say whatever it takes to make them happy in the moment,\nbut once things get too real, your story changes.": "",
  "Five women have filed reports with the Consumer Affairs Bureau,\nand those are just the ones who have stepped forward.": "",
  "Of the women you've deceived, all upstanding citizens,\nfive have filed reports with the Consumer Affairs Bureau.": "",
  "Can we really trust the words\nof such a manipulative man?": "",
  "This man's clients know him to be a liar and manipulator.\nCan we really trust his word?": "",
  "With these character traits in mind, I sincerely doubt\nthe credibility of the witness's testimony.": "",
  "And if the witness is indeed lying,\nthe defendant's alibi is invalid.": "",
  "That is all.": "",
  "I'd like to continue on the topic of credibility.\nMind if I ask you a few questions, Prosecutor?": "",
  "I'd like to continue on the topic of credibility.\nI have a few questions for you, Prosecutor.": "",
  "Go ahead.": "",
  "First, allow me to fast forward the security footage\nto just a few days after the crime.": "",
  "First, allow me to play the security footage\nrecorded just a few days after the crime.": "",
  "Oddly enough, we'll be looking at the exact day\nthe prosecution filed their suit.": "",
  "Hm...?": "",
  "Isn't that... you, Prosecutor?": "",
  "This is you, is it not, Prosecutor?": "",
  "Huh? Yes...": "",
  "Well... yes.": "",
  "And in this footage, you're re-enacting the altercation\nthat took place between the defendant and our witness, yes?": "",
  "And in this footage, you're re-enacting the altercation\nthat took place between the defendant and our witness. Am I right?": "",
  "What? No...": "",
  "Huh? Well...": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
